			"color":"#4b5563",
			"widgets_values":[
				"This is a vertical fashion e-commerce product image with a clean white background, advertising a high-waisted pleated maxi skirt. At the top, a bold blue headline reads \"高腰又显瘦!\" (High-waisted and slimming!), followed by a black subheadline \"H型/梨型身材解决方案\" (Solution for H-shape/pear-shape figures). Three lines of gray body text below explain the design: precise waist-hip stitching, rejection of the \"puffy feel\" of ordinary pleated skirts, and a \"tighten-top-release-bottom\" cut for pear-shaped bodies.\n\nIn the center stands a slim female model taking a mirror selfie, her face fully obscured by a white smartphone held in her right hand. She wears a black bucket hat with long brown hair falling over her shoulders, a brown knit cardigan draped off one shoulder over a black cropped tank top, and a light beige/cream pleated A-line maxi skirt cinched with a thin black belt featuring a silver buckle. On her feet are white sneakers with black side stripes and tan gum soles. A small tattoo is visible on her upper left arm. A metal chair leg peeks in at the right edge.\n\nThree dashed-line callouts with gray dot markers annotate the skirt's features: near the waist, \"高腰 +1.5cm / 轾腿滤镜 一键小蛮腰\" (high waist +1.5cm, leg-slimming filter, one-tap tiny waist); at the mid-skirt, \"A摆 +4° / 藏假胯宽 肉大腿\" (A-line +4°, hides wide hips and thick thighs); and at the hem, \"裙长 +2cm / 遮粗小腿 灵动不拖沓\" (skirt length +2cm, covers thick calves, lively not dumpy). No celebrities or fictional characters appear; the model is an anonymous fashion showcase."
			],
